        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and share Mercer Mayer’s classic, &quot;Little Monster at School&quot;, adapted from the original, &quot;Little Monster&quot;, storybooks into an interactive animated adventure! Little Monster brings the story alive one word at a time, offering an easy to digest reading mode which is fully animated and voiced. Increase the challenge and the fun with an interactive at-your-own-pace option with lots of bonuses and secrets to discover!<br><br>Little Monster at School centers around a young Little Monster as he is dropped of at school by his mom. He gets to participate in all kinds of school activities featuring a wide array of subjects. Learning so many different things, such as: letters, numbers, geography, and music. However, don’t forget about playtime! There are lots of activities to discover, and interesting characters to meet. Will Little Monster make any new friends today?<br><br>Since it's first release in 1993, Living Books' rendition of &quot;Little Monster at School&quot; has been enjoyed by countless children. Step-by-step, the reader will find the story is full of all the charming encounters that have made Mercer Mayer’s Little Monster books enduring classics. All while providing new ways to interact with the book again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both interactive and story modes suitable for different levels of skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the pictures and discover hidden scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attractive animations bring the characters to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced as you read! Chock full of memorable interactive scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A revitalized re-release compatible with modern platforms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great way to improve reading skills.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and share Mercer Mayer’s classic, &quot;Little Monster at School&quot;, adapted from the original, &quot;Little Monster&quot;, storybooks into an interactive animated adventure! Little Monster brings the story alive one word at a time, offering an easy to digest reading mode which is fully animated and voiced. Increase the challenge and the fun with an interactive at-your-own-pace option with lots of bonuses and secrets to discover!<br><br>Little Monster at School centers around a young Little Monster as he is dropped of at school by his mom. He gets to participate in all kinds of school activities featuring a wide array of subjects. Learning so many different things, such as: letters, numbers, geography, and music. However, don’t forget about playtime! There are lots of activities to discover, and interesting characters to meet. Will Little Monster make any new friends today?<br><br>Since it's first release in 1993, Living Books' rendition of &quot;Little Monster at School&quot; has been enjoyed by countless children. Step-by-step, the reader will find the story is full of all the charming encounters that have made Mercer Mayer’s Little Monster books enduring classics. All while providing new ways to interact with the book again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both interactive and story modes suitable for different levels of skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the pictures and discover hidden scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attractive animations bring the characters to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced as you read! Chock full of memorable interactive scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A revitalized re-release compatible with modern platforms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great way to improve reading skills.</p></li></ul>",
